OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FBecoming
OL,6,Fincreasingly clear in the south. Clear
OL,7,Fspells and blustery showers along
OL,8,Fexposed northern coasts, and wintry
OL,9,Fshowers over Scottish hills. Fog
OL,10,Flikely for some north England valleys.
OL,11,FGales arriving in the far northeast.
OL,12,FCold, with frost in the north.
OL,13,
OL,14,CThursday:FSunny with a chilly breeze
OL,15,Ffor most. Spells of blustery showers
OL,16,Fand strong winds along northern and
OL,17,Feastern coasts, with snow for Scottish
OL,18,Fhills, and gales for northeast
OL,19,FScotland.
